Date: Fri, 14 Mar 2025 17:26:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 711/913] dts: stm32mp15: remove PMIC IRQ source description on
 STM32MP15

The PMIC interrupts are actually handled by linux
when the PMIC is not secured.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 132dcc7fbef6b284a139e79eb49c83e4a8fb3240 dts: stm32mp15: remove PMIC IRQ source description on STM32MP15]
